[{"id":1754874,"html_url":"https://gitea.com/gitea/tea/issues/1129#issuecomment-1754874","pull_request_url":"","issue_url":"https://gitea.com/gitea/tea/issues/1129","user":{"id":173651,"login":"bircni","type":"User","login_name":"","source_id":0,"full_name":"bircni","email":"173651+bircni@noreply.gitea.com","avatar_url":"https://gitea.com/avatars/9b753b6bef510146768e173e70a1a3904a76262c3a0b95e6579d06976650f3d4","html_url":"https://gitea.com/bircni","language":"","is_admin":false,"last_login":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","created":"2026-01-25T11:14:23Z","restricted":false,"active":false,"prohibit_login":false,"location":"","website":"","description":"","visibility":"public","followers_count":0,"following_count":2,"starred_repos_count":2,"username":"bircni"},"original_author":"","original_author_id":0,"body":"目前 Gitea API 没有\"无指派人\"的筛选条件，可以在客户端过滤（需要 tea 1.0，即当前 main 分支）：\n\n```\ntea issue list --state all --limit 100 --json number,title,assignees --jq '.[] | select(.assignees | length == 0)'\n```\n\n超过 100 条时请配合 `--page 2`、`--page 3` 等翻页。\n\n(Gitea's API has no \"unassigned\" filter, so filter client-side as above with tea 1.0; use `--page` for more than 100 issues.)","assets":[],"created_at":"2026-10-11T18:41:02Z","updated_at":"2026-10-11T18:41:02Z"},{"id":1757615,"html_url":"https://gitea.com/gitea/tea/issues/1129#issuecomment-1757615","pull_request_url":"","issue_url":"https://gitea.com/gitea/tea/issues/1129","user":{"id":253804,"login":"mfk1","type":"User","login_name":"","source_id":0,"full_name":"","email":"253804+mfk1@noreply.gitea.com","avatar_url":"https://gitea.com/avatars/065f76328357c404dd8f46dd71c4bd4605b27b9f97d22412f2c6dc0034d309bb","html_url":"https://gitea.com/mfk1","language":"","is_admin":false,"last_login":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","created":"2026-10-10T02:24:40Z","restricted":false,"active":false,"prohibit_login":false,"location":"","website":"","description":"","visibility":"public","followers_count":0,"following_count":0,"starred_repos_count":0,"username":"mfk1"},"original_author":"","original_author_id":0,"body":"1.  这是一个常用需求， 我作为领导，要找出所有没有指派人的工单来分派一个工单， 你的方式过于复杂\n2.  用 jq 时只表 json 格式有效，  table 格式无效","assets":[],"created_at":"2026-10-12T04:39:37Z","updated_at":"2026-10-12T04:40:36Z"},{"id":1805187,"html_url":"https://gitea.com/gitea/tea/issues/1129#issuecomment-1805187","pull_request_url":"","issue_url":"https://gitea.com/gitea/tea/issues/1129","user":{"id":173651,"login":"bircni","type":"User","login_name":"","source_id":0,"full_name":"bircni","email":"173651+bircni@noreply.gitea.com","avatar_url":"https://gitea.com/avatars/9b753b6bef510146768e173e70a1a3904a76262c3a0b95e6579d06976650f3d4","html_url":"https://gitea.com/bircni","language":"","is_admin":false,"last_login":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","created":"2026-01-25T11:14:23Z","restricted":false,"active":false,"prohibit_login":false,"location":"","website":"","description":"","visibility":"public","followers_count":0,"following_count":2,"starred_repos_count":2,"username":"bircni"},"original_author":"","original_author_id":0,"body":"This is covered by the new Gitea CLI, `gt` (gitea-cli): https://gitea.com/gitea/cli\n\nHow: `gt issue list --no-assignee` (also `gt pr list --no-assignee`)\n\nPlease give it a try (see the README for installation, e.g. `brew install gitea-cli`) and let us know here if it does not work for your case.\n\nThis comment was written with Claude.\n","assets":[],"created_at":"2026-10-23T18:12:40Z","updated_at":"2026-10-23T18:12:40Z"},{"id":1823068,"html_url":"https://gitea.com/gitea/tea/issues/1129#issuecomment-1823068","pull_request_url":"","issue_url":"https://gitea.com/gitea/tea/issues/1129","user":{"id":173651,"login":"bircni","type":"User","login_name":"","source_id":0,"full_name":"bircni","email":"173651+bircni@noreply.gitea.com","avatar_url":"https://gitea.com/avatars/9b753b6bef510146768e173e70a1a3904a76262c3a0b95e6579d06976650f3d4","html_url":"https://gitea.com/bircni","language":"","is_admin":false,"last_login":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","created":"2026-01-25T11:14:23Z","restricted":false,"active":false,"prohibit_login":false,"location":"","website":"","description":"","visibility":"public","followers_count":0,"following_count":2,"starred_repos_count":2,"username":"bircni"},"original_author":"","original_author_id":0,"body":"tea is getting replaced by https://gitea.com/gitea/cli and this was implemented there - feel free to test it out and open new issues there","assets":[],"created_at":"2026-10-29T17:34:31Z","updated_at":"2026-10-29T17:34:31Z"}]